    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Fantasy Madness: Bloodbath! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this roguelike action-survival game set in a wildpunk World of Fantasy, your goal is to stand against evil forces who want to destroy the natural order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/cb17d190862cd389012efccac88ab90f.poster.avif?t=1741189391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/cb17d190862cd389012efccac88ab90f.webm?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/cb17d190862cd389012efccac88ab90f.mp4?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect magical crystals to earn new powers allowing you to summon fierce allies, deadly weapons and digest enchanted mushrooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/5357cd333b661930ce1d032a9fd7c182.poster.avif?t=1741189391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/5357cd333b661930ce1d032a9fd7c182.webm?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/5357cd333b661930ce1d032a9fd7c182.mp4?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bring retribution using wide arsenal of arcane powers granted by beloved Mother Nature:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magical staves for more firepower? Checked! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bloodthirsty butterflies offering health transfer? Checked! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast-bringing squirrel squad? Ready to serve!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deadly vines and roots to stop charging enemies? Of course! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hellish squealing hog for light-speed mobility? On its way! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sweet little carnivore bunnies to rip off throats? As you wish! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ready to smash down Orcs from the clan of Aluminum Helmets, Dwarves from the BigMine cartel or the Oilmancy Cult? Then go and bring them Bloodbath!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/b0532a46a4222615107599d0bd01dad5.poster.avif?t=1741189391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/b0532a46a4222615107599d0bd01dad5.webm?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/b0532a46a4222615107599d0bd01dad5.mp4?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Now let\u2019s point out a couple of features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play one of several different game modes with unique objectives including Elimination, Survival, Conquest, Capture The Mushroom and more,  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different biomes, each with its own family of enemies (including bosses), </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 unique playable champions, each with its own set of skills, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 unique skills, each with a special max-level power (21 skills per champion),  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up to 8 skills out of available 21 to get the most powerful build, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and equip dozens of powerful Runes and Artifacts to improve your skills and earn new powers, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Humor, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cartoonish bloodshed (optional!), </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wildpunk theme (fantasy with an \u201cunconventional\u201d twist), </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn arts, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast action that requires a little bit of reflexes and dexterity.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Fantasy Madness: Bloodbath! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this roguelike action-survival game set in a wildpunk World of Fantasy, your goal is to stand against evil forces who want to destroy the natural order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/cb17d190862cd389012efccac88ab90f.poster.avif?t=1741189391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/cb17d190862cd389012efccac88ab90f.webm?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/cb17d190862cd389012efccac88ab90f.mp4?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect magical crystals to earn new powers allowing you to summon fierce allies, deadly weapons and digest enchanted mushrooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/5357cd333b661930ce1d032a9fd7c182.poster.avif?t=1741189391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/5357cd333b661930ce1d032a9fd7c182.webm?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/5357cd333b661930ce1d032a9fd7c182.mp4?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bring retribution using wide arsenal of arcane powers granted by beloved Mother Nature:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magical staves for more firepower? Checked! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bloodthirsty butterflies offering health transfer? Checked! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast-bringing squirrel squad? Ready to serve!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deadly vines and roots to stop charging enemies? Of course! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hellish squealing hog for light-speed mobility? On its way! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sweet little carnivore bunnies to rip off throats? As you wish! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ready to smash down Orcs from the clan of Aluminum Helmets, Dwarves from the BigMine cartel or the Oilmancy Cult? Then go and bring them Bloodbath!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/b0532a46a4222615107599d0bd01dad5.poster.avif?t=1741189391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/b0532a46a4222615107599d0bd01dad5.webm?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185180/extras/b0532a46a4222615107599d0bd01dad5.mp4?t=1741189391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Now let\u2019s point out a couple of features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play one of several different game modes with unique objectives including Elimination, Survival, Conquest, Capture The Mushroom and more,  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different biomes, each with its own family of enemies (including bosses), </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 unique playable champions, each with its own set of skills, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 unique skills, each with a special max-level power (21 skills per champion),  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up to 8 skills out of available 21 to get the most powerful build, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and equip dozens of powerful Runes and Artifacts to improve your skills and earn new powers, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Humor, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cartoonish bloodshed (optional!), </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wildpunk theme (fantasy with an \u201cunconventional\u201d twist), </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn arts, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast action that requires a little bit of reflexes and dexterity.</p></li></ul>",
